<title>USA: IPO FILING-CTB International Corp.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING-CTB International Corp.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name			CTB International Corp</p>
<p>Stock symbol			CTBC.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $14-$16/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    5.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 5.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    12,881,804</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter:</p>
<p>	    Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment   750,000 shrs</p>
<p>Business: Based in Milford, Ind., CTB is a manufacturer and marketer of automated feeding, watering and ventilation systems, feed bins, grain storage bins and integrated commercial egg laying and handling systems for the poultry, swine and egg production industries. Use of Proceeds: To repay debt and the balance if any to finance general working capital needs.</p>
</text>
